    "updated": "2026-10-11",
    "body": "## Steps\n\n1. **Invite patients.** Open a patient on **Patients** and click **Invite to\n   chat**. Send the English or Filipino message from the clinic's phone, or let\n   the patient scan the QR code at the front desk. The patient picks an app,\n   replies with their **date of birth**, then **YES**.\n2. **Check it worked.** The patient's **Chat apps** table shows **Active** once\n   they've said YES.\n3. **Create a chat campaign.** On **New campaign**, choose **Chat message with a\n   booking link** for How to reach patients, tick the patients and save.\n4. **Start sending.** On the campaign page, click **Start sending**. Messages go\n   out inside calling hours. Invite anyone listed as **needs chat invite**.\n5. **Optional, once SMS is set up:** in Clinic settings turn on **Chat app\n   invites in text messages** so call campaigns invite patients too.\n6. After a few days, ask CC how many patients booked and how many messages went\n   out per app.\n\nA clinic-wide front-desk QR code (not tied to one patient) is planned."
